# The implementation of microeconomics teaching in pharmacoeconomics course

**Authors:** Bin Zheng, Na Li, Zhiliang Zhao

## Abstract
Pharmacoeconomics is an emerging interdiscipline, and microeconomics is the professional foundation of it. However at present the teaching system of microeconomics in pharmacoeconomics course has not been established. In this article, starting from the goal of cultivating applied pharmaceutical talents, the teaching characteristics of microeconomics in pharmacoeconomics course was analyzed in combination with the teaching practice, and the new teaching model of microeconomics was proposed on the basis of it. Some exploration and practice had been carried on from three aspects, the teaching contents, teaching methods and teaching effect evaluating, and the strategies had been put forward to improve the teaching quality of microeconomics in pharmacoeconomics course. 
 
 
Key words: 
Microeconomics; Course; Teaching; Pharmacoeconomics

